$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Yoshida, Hiroto; Kageyuki, Ikuo; Takaki, Ken
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Organic Letters (2014), 16(13), 3512-3515

